  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector competitiveness Strategy for Ukraine</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sector competitiveness Strategy for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige bidrar till OECDs &quot;Sector Competitiveness Strategy for        Ukraine&quot;, 2009 - 2015. Huvudsektorer &#xe4;r jordbruksn&#xe4;ring, byggande av  maskineri och transportredskap, f&#xf6;rnybara energik&#xe4;llor och teknologi  f&#xf6;r energieffektivitet. Som ett komplement till de analytiska         studierna kring jordbruksn&#xe4;ringen har Sida f&#xe5;tt ett f&#xf6;rslag att       st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av ett kreditgarantisystem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden is supporting the OECD &quot;Sector Competitiveness Strategy for    Ukraine&quot;, 2009 -2015. Key sectors are agribusiness, machinery and     transport equipment manufacturing, renewable and energy-efficiency    technologies sectors. As a complement to the above, Sida is proposed  to support a Credit Guarantee Scheme for Small and Medium Enterprises in agribusiness (2013-2015).</narrative>
  </description>
